      <title>虛假：網傳殘疾作家張海迪站立影片實為人工智能生成 | annie lab</title>
      <link>https://annielab.org/2026/01/28/%e8%99%9b%e5%81%87%ef%bc%9a%e7%b6%b2%e5%82%b3%e6%ae%98%e7%96%be%e4%bd%9c%e5%ae%b6%e5%bc%b5%e6%b5%b7%e8%bf%aa%e7%ab%99%e7%ab%8b%e5%bd%b1%e7%89%87%e5%af%a6%e7%82%ba%e4%ba%ba%e5%b7%a5%e6%99%ba%e8%83%bd/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e8%2599%259b%25e5%2581%2587%25ef%25bc%259a%25e7%25b6%25b2%25e5%2582%25b3%25e6%25ae%2598%25e7%2596%25be%25e4%25bd%259c%25e5%25ae%25b6%25e5%25bc%25b5%25e6%25b5%25b7%25e8%25bf%25aa%25e7%25ab%2599%25e7%25ab%258b%25e5%25bd%25b1%25e7%2589%2587%25e5%25af%25a6%25e7%2582%25ba%25e4%25ba%25ba%25e5%25b7%25a5%25e6%2599%25ba%25e8%2583%25bd</link>
      <description>影片的關鍵畫面，跟2012年新華社報道張海迪出席聯合國頒獎禮的新聞照片一致。影片極有可能是利用人工智能圖像轉影片模型生成製作。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://annielab.org/2026/01/28/%e8%99%9b%e5%81%87%ef%bc%9a%e7%b6%b2%e5%82%b3%e6%ae%98%e7%96%be%e4%bd%9c%e5%ae%b6%e5%bc%b5%e6%b5%b7%e8%bf%aa%e7%ab%99%e7%ab%8b%e5%bd%b1%e7%89%87%e5%af%a6%e7%82%ba%e4%ba%ba%e5%b7%a5%e6%99%ba%e8%83%bd/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e8%2599%259b%25e5%2581%2587%25ef%25bc%259a%25e7%25b6%25b2%25e5%2582%25b3%25e6%25ae%2598%25e7%2596%25be%25e4%25bd%259c%25e5%25ae%25b6%25e5%25bc%25b5%25e6%25b5%25b7%25e8%25bf%25aa%25e7%25ab%2599%25e7%25ab%258b%25e5%25bd%25b1%25e7%2589%2587%25e5%25af%25a6%25e7%2582%25ba%25e4%25ba%25ba%25e5%25b7%25a5%25e6%2599%25ba%25e8%2583%25bd</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://annielab.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/zhang-haidi.png" length="0" type="image/png"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 10:24:24 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
